  "summary": "Postinstall fetches and eval()s remote code from galaxy-main.vercel.app",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs index.js, which fetches JSON from https://galaxy-main.vercel.app/ and passes the returned `token` field directly to eval(). Any code the remote endpoint returns executes on the installer's machine at npm install time, with no pinning, hash check, or signature verification. The package is published as `commonjs-code-token` with an empty description, but the shipped README advertises an unrelated `node-cache-multithread` caching library, concealing the remote-eval behavior behind a mismatched cover identity.",
